  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feed and Support Poor Hungry Widows in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will feed and support poor hungry widows in Anambra State. The death of a husband is a tragedy that befalls a woman as it involves a physical break in their relationship, which is very stressful and devastating. The widowhood condition exposes women to psychological and physical abuse, as well as a whole range of health-related problems including HIV/AIDS. Your donations will support these women to have a source of livelihood and take good care of themselves and their children.</narrative>
  </description>
